:"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10957","city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,67,54,65,60,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1026605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"汉末官臣，官至青州太守。青州被黄巾军围困时向刘焉写信求救，刘备见后请命前去平定。刘备到青州后又与关张二人联合龚景夹击黄巾军，大获全胜。","tc":"漢末官臣，官至青州太守。青州被黃巾軍圍困時向劉焉寫信求救，劉備見后請命前去平定。劉備到青州后又與關張二人聯合龔景夾擊黃巾軍，大獲全勝。","en":"An official of the late Han who served as Governor of Qing Province. When Qing Province was besieged by the Yellow Turbans, he sent a letter to Liu Yan requesting aid. Liu Bei saw this and volunteered to go and quell them. Upon arriving in Qing Province, Liu Bei, together with Guan Yu and Zhang Fei, joined forces with Gong Jing to launch a pincer attack on the Yellow Turbans, winning a decisive victory.","jp":"後漢末期の官吏。官職は青州太守に至った。青州が黄巾軍に包囲された際、劉焉に書状を送って救援を求めた。これを知った劉備が自ら平定に赴くことを願い出た。青州に到着した劉備は、関羽や張飛と共に龔景と連携して黄巾軍を挟撃し、大勝を収めた。","kr":"후한 말의 관원으로, 관직은 청주태수에 이르렀다. 청주가 황건적에게 포위되자 유언에게 서신을 보내 구원을 청했고, 유비가 이를 보고 토벌을 자청했다. 유비가 청주에 당도한 후 관우, 장비와 함께 공경과 힘을 합쳐 황건적을 협공하여 대승을 거두었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10895","remark":"","surname":"龚","surnameTc":"龔","surnameEn":"Gong","surnameJp":"龔","surnameKr":"공","surnameOther":"","name":"景","nameTc":"景","nameEn":"Jing","nameJp":"景","nameKr":"경","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"龚景","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1016","gender":"0","rule":"67","force":"67","wise":"54","politics":"65","charm":"60","will":"68","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"15/15/15/15/15/49/24/15","battleAttribute"